@startuml Sequence: Полиномиальное представление
participant MainWindow
participant PolynomialDialog
participant AppController
participant LogicModule as "logic"
participant Circuit

MainWindow -> PolynomialDialog : show()
PolynomialDialog -> AppController : get_polynomials()
AppController -> LogicModule : get_polynomials(circuit)
LogicModule -> Circuit : validate_structure()
LogicModule -> Circuit : traverse nodes
LogicModule -> LogicModule : _polynomial_for_node() (recursive)
LogicModule --> AppController : dict[node_id → poly]
AppController --> PolynomialDialog
PolynomialDialog -> PolynomialDialog : отображение в TreeWidget + TextEdit
@enduml